<template data-form-unavailable><p role="status" data-message style="margin:22px 0 0;padding-top:14px;border-top:3px solid var(--n-gold-lt);max-width:48ch;color:var(--n-white)">Email notices are not running yet, so nothing was sent. The <a href="/events/">events calendar</a> carries the same updates in the meantime.</p></template>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:12px 0 0;max-width:48ch;color:var(--n-sage-lt)">Your address is used only for these notices. No advertising and no third-party tracking.</p>
